les, realistic fabric drape, natural limb proportions, and accurate light falloff on contours. Hair texture must remain authentic in all views.\n\nThe subject's identity, facial proportions, hairstyle, body proportions, outfit, and overall styling must exactly match the reference image; however, the background across all panels must be unified as the identical textured gray studio backdrop.\n\nStrictly prohibit adding any text, watermarks, logos, subtitles, UI elements, borders, panel labels (A/B/C/1/2/3), angle annotations, measurement guides, or any other additional content of any kind."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [305.9375, 474.859375], "pos": [-2116.726806640625, 186.7847442626953], "id": 192, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [379], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [225, 54], "pos": [-181.5726776123047, 333.8999938964844], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 331, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 332, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 162, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [343], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["FireRed-Image-Edit-1.0_fp8mixed_comfy.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype